<title>POLAND: JELFA JAN NET FLAT AT PLN 2.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>JELFA JAN NET FLAT AT PLN 2.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.03 vs   2.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.96 vs   2.97</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.35 vs   2.89</p>
<p> Sales		   16.10 vs  12.06</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish pharmaceuticals firm is Jelfa</p>
<p>SA.	-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
